---
description: Bloc/Cubit state management and Riverpod-only DI
globs: "**/*.dart"
alwaysApply: true
---

# State + DI (mandatory)

- State: Bloc/Cubit only. Cubit for simple cases, Bloc when events are needed.
- Every feature with business logic has its own Bloc/Cubit.
- Blocs/Cubits depend only on Use Cases.
- States are immutable (freezed or equatable). Always include loading, success, failure, empty.
- DI: Riverpod providers only. Never instantiate dependencies in widgets or Blocs.
- Create Blocs/Cubits via Riverpod + `BlocProvider`. Never use Riverpod as state management.

```dart
// ❌ BAD
final cubit = TransferCubit(SendMoney(TransferRepositoryImpl()));

// ✅ GOOD — Riverpod provides the use case; BlocProvider provides the cubit
```
